// MISTAKE: the payment of March was never written, and the lender's statement is what the book holds: the schedule paid it. The difference is exactly that payment's principal.
base USD
use std

entity bank : lender
account checking : bank
asset condo : property

opening 2026-01-01
  checking 900_000 USD

contract mortgage with bank
  loan 120_000 USD on 2026-01-15 at 6% over 3y for condo
  monthly on 1 from checking
  from 2026-02-01
  until 2026-04-30

2026-01-15 mortgage

2026-02-01 mortgage
2026-04-01 mortgage
2026-04-02 mortgage = 113_868.16 USD
